                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm">
                                <li><strong>Unit tests</strong> that ran automatically</li>
                                <li><strong>A shared coding style</strong> across the team</li>
                                <li><strong>Integration tests</strong> checking features end to end</li>
                                <li><strong>Demos</strong> to gather user feedback</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Team Collaboration Highlights</h3>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-3">Development Practices</h4>
