                                    <li>• A retrospective after each sprint to improve the next</li>
                                    <li>• Pair programming on the harder features</li>
                                    <li>• Sessions where we taught each other what we knew</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-3">Technical Achievements</h4>
