                                    <li>• A clean commit history with clear messages</li>
                                    <li>• A detailed wiki with architecture diagrams</li>
                                    <li>• A successful live demo of the product</li>
                                    <li>• A tidy codebase in a consistent style</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

